            <ArticleTitle>[Prospects for correcting the disrupted status of the cardiovascular system in acute myocardial ischemia by combined experimental use of phosphocreatine and corinfar].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>66-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Individual and simultaneous influence of phosphocreatine and calcium antagonist corinfar on hemodynamics patterns was studied in experimental acute ischemia of myocardium. Simultaneous treatment with phosphocreatine and corinfar may be effective in ischemic impairment of myocardium.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
